{"title": "Astral-Touched Tadpole", "pageid": 16099, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole", "categories": ["Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png/300px-Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/7/79/Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png/300px-Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Astral_Tadpole_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Astral-Touched Tadpole</span></a> is capable of evolving you or another illithid-infected <a href=\"/wiki/Companion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Companion\">companion</a> into a <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-illithid\" title=\"Partial-illithid\">partial-illithid</a> with more psionically powerful <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers#Elite_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid powers</a>. Using it is an objective of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Embrace_Your_Potential\" title=\"Embrace Your Potential\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Embrace Your Potential\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Embrace_Your_Potential\" title=\"Embrace Your Potential\">Embrace Your Potential</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Though a thick coating of astral frost prevents this parasite from squirming, you feel an immense psychic weight writhe and roil within. It has languished in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Astral_Plane%23Deities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sea of Dead Gods\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Astral_Plane%23Deities\">Sea of Dead Gods</a></span> for countless millennia -- learning, gathering potential. It is something old ready to become new again. It is ready for evolution.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7897adae3be97fd2END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e697e696baabe15cEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2f675bcd9deaf3ceEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_MF_Tadpole_Astral_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_MF_Tadpole_Astral_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_MF_Tadpole_Astral_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4a82e6f2-839f-434e-addf-b07dd1578194</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4a82e6f2-839f-434e-addf-b07dd1578194\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4a82e6f2-839f-434e-addf-b07dd1578194\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBJ_GenericLootItem</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_GenericLootItem+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:OBJ_GenericLootItem+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>User transforms into a partial-illithid and is granted the following illithid powers:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentrated_Blast\" title=\"Concentrated Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentrated Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentrated_Blast\" title=\"Concentrated Blast\">Concentrated Blast</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/38px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/50px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Favourable Beginnings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\">Favourable Beginnings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/38px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/50px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\">Fly</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force_Tunnel\" title=\"Force Tunnel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/38px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/50px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force Tunnel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Tunnel\" title=\"Force Tunnel\">Force Tunnel</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Overload\" title=\"Psionic Overload\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/25px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/38px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/50px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Overload\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/25px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Overload\" title=\"Psionic Overload\">Psionic Overload</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/25px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/38px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/50px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transfuse Health\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/25px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\">Transfuse Health</a></li></ul>\n<p>For any power already unlocked by the character that communes or eats this tadpole, one normal tadpole is refunded back to the unusued tadpoles. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/38px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/50px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/25px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor\" title=\"The Emperor\">The Emperor</a> at the beginning of <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>, after assisting it in defending itself from members of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus'</a> Honour Guard in the <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Plane\" title=\"Astral Plane\">Astral Plane</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The tadpole can be eaten, communed with or destroyed. The last of which is only an option if having avoided consuming tadpoles so far. Eating or communing with the tadpole results in the party member receiving its powers; however, if it is eaten, it cannot be communed with by other members of the party.</li>\n<li>Any character who communes with (or eats) the tadpole irrevocably changes in appearance, gaining darkened eyes and prominent black veins over their entire body; the <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Mirror\" title=\"Magic Mirror\">Magic Mirror</a> cannot be used to reverse this change. To selectively remove the cosmetic changes using third-party tools, see <a href=\"/wiki/Guide:Partial-illithid\" title=\"Guide:Partial-illithid\">Guide:Partial-illithid</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Communing with this tadpole in the middle of combat does not grant the powers this special tadpole traditionally gives.\n<ul><li>However, a party member who communes with it in combat still gains the Tadpoles necessary to gain the Mind Flayer powers that communing with the tadpole traditionally grants - i.e., a character who has not invested in any Mind Flayer abilities at all gains six tadpoles, one for each of:</li></ul></li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentrated_Blast\" title=\"Concentrated Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/38px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/50px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentrated Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp/25px-Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentrated_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentrated_Blast\" title=\"Concentrated Blast\">Concentrated Blast</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/38px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/50px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Favourable Beginnings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp/25px-Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Favourable_Beginnings_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Favourable_Beginnings\" title=\"Favourable Beginnings\">Favourable Beginnings</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/38px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/50px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp/25px-Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Fly_Illithid_Power_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fly_(Illithid_Power)\" title=\"Fly (Illithid Power)\">Fly</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force_Tunnel\" title=\"Force Tunnel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/38px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/50px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force Tunnel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/19/Force_Tunnel_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Tunnel\" title=\"Force Tunnel\">Force Tunnel</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Overload\" title=\"Psionic Overload\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/25px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/38px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/50px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Overload\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp/25px-Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Psionic_Overload_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Overload\" title=\"Psionic Overload\">Psionic Overload</a> - and</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/25px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/38px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/50px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transfuse Health\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp/25px-Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Transfuse_Health_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transfuse_Health\" title=\"Transfuse Health\">Transfuse Health</a></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>Notably, a party member needs to \"work their way through the tech tree\" to unlock Fly, unlike when it is traditionally unlocked.</li></ul></dd></dl>\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/30px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/45px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/60px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png/30px-Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen_Item_Icon.png\" class